= Russellian semantics =
====== short ======
The view, at least intermittently held by Russell, that propositions are
composed of the “objects, properties and relations” that they represent.

====== related to ======
hub: [[influential_semantic_theories]]
[[timeline_of_early_analytic_philosophers#Russell]]


[[contextual_definition]]

